OL,3,GNEWSACharity feeding 1,000 people a day
OL,4,Aafter Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity says it is struggling to
OL,7,Freach starving families in Nepal, a
OL,8,Fweek after the devastating floods
OL,9,Fdestroyed thousands of homes and killed
OL,10,Fmore than 1,300 people.
OL,12,FFeed the Hungry has 25 volunteers on
OL,13,Fthe ground delivering rice and flour to
OL,14,Fvillages cut off by the floods more
OL,15,Fthan a week ago.
OL,17,FBut is said there were thousands more
OL,18,Fpeople they haven't been able to reach,
OL,19,Fwith many roads unpassable, meaning it
OL,20,Fis taking hours to reach places only a
OL,21,Ffew kilometres away.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
