OL,3,GNEWSACharity feeding 1,000 people a day
OL,4,Aafter Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,F"After three days we went to a village
OL,7,Fand we met several people. They were
OL,8,Fsaying that they were starving.
OL,9,FChildren were crying for the food",
OL,10,Fsaid Pastor Ruben Rasaili, who is
OL,11,Frunning the team in Nepal.
